About this project

miles-sandbox is a JAX / TPU risk-reduction sandbox. It produces
microbenchmarks, HLO analyses, and short technical memos that answer
TPU-specific feasibility questions about a possible future JAX port of
the MILES-CREDIT weather modeling framework.

This work is conducted in coordination with the MILES (Machine
Integration and Learning for Earth Systems) group at NSF NCAR. It is
not a UCAR / NCAR product, and no endorsement by UCAR or NCAR is
implied.

